(AnchorScore is computed after generation. Raters split the answer into claims, then mark) Tj
/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 710.00 Tm
(each claim anchored or unsupported. The metric ignores tone, grammar, and answer length. A) Tj
/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 695.00 Tm
(correct fact that is not present in the retrieved passages still counts as unsupported,) Tj
/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 680.00 Tm
(because the assistant was not allowed to leave the document.) Tj
/F2 12.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 655.00 Tm
(4. Experiments) Tj
/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 634.00 Tm
(Condition A used retrieval. Condition B used the same generator with an empty document.) Tj
/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 619.00 Tm
(Condition A reached 91 percent faithfulness. Condition B reached 54 percent faithfulness.) Tj
/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 604.00 Tm
(The 37-point gap is the main result of the paper. On the numeric subset alone, Condition A) Tj
/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 589.00 Tm
(scored 88 percent and Condition B scored 41 percent.) Tj
/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 571.00 Tm
(We also varied chunk size while holding the retriever fixed. Chunks of 200, 400, 800, and) Tj
/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 556.00 Tm
(1200 tokens were compared on recall of the supporting sentence. The 800-token setting was) Tj
/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 541.00 Tm
(best. The 200-token setting reduced recall by 11 percentage points relative to 800 tokens.) Tj
/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 526.00 Tm
(The 1200-token setting was 3 points below 800 because the extra context diluted the match.) Tj
/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 508.00 Tm
