/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 493.00 Tm
(and the source passage. The mean rating was 4.2. The median rating was 4. No rater was an) Tj
/F1 11.0 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 478.00 Tm
(author of this paper.) Tj
